window.products.push({"id":1000090,"name":"Lodge Cast Iron Serving Pot Cast Iron Double Dutch Oven, 5-Quart & Cast Iron Skillet with Red Silicone Hot Handle Holder, 12-inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z6qlwnjYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Lodge Pre-Seasoned Cast Iron Double Dutch Oven With Loop Handles, 5 qtThe Lodge 5 Quart Cast Iron Double Dutch Oven is every cook’s dream with a lid that easily converts to a 10.25 Inch skillet and a domed cover to provide space for roasts, no-knead bread recipes, soups, and stews. Complete with loop handles for easy lifting and control, it provides excellent heat distribution and retention for consistent, even cooking. It offers an abundance of possibilities. Use to sear, sauté, bake, broil, braise, fry, or grill. It’s safe to use in the oven, on the stove or grill, and over a campfire. The Lodge Cast Iron Double Dutch Oven is made for decades of cooking and comes pre-seasoned with oil for an easy-release finish that improves with use. Includes one Lodge 5 Quart Cast Iron Double Dutch Oven. Made in America. Care instructions for cast iron: 1. Wash with warm water. Add a mild soap, if desired. 2. Dry thoroughly with a lint-free cloth or paper towel. 3. Oil the surface of the pan with a very light layer of cooking oil while warm. Hang or store the cookware in a dry place.Lodge Pre-Seasoned Cast Iron Skillet with Assist Handle Holder, 12\", Red SiliconeThe Lodge 12 Inch Cast Iron Skillet will be your go-to skillet for years to come. Featuring an assist handle for great control and an easy-grip handle for lifting or hanging storage when not in use, it provides excellent heat distribution and retention for consistent, even cooking. It offers an abundance of possibilities. Use to sear, sauté, bake, broil, braise, fry, or grill. This skillet is safe to use in the oven, on the stove or grill, and over a campfire. The Lodge Cast Iron Skillet is brutally tough for decades of cooking and comes pre-seasoned for an easy-release finish that improves with use. Includes one Lodge 12 Inch Cast Iron Skillet and one Silicon Handle Holder. Made in America. Care instructions for cast iron: 1. Wash with warm water. Add a mild soap, if desired. 2. Dry thoroughly with a lint-free cloth or paper towel. 3. Oil the surface of the pan with a very light layer of cooking oil while warm. Hang or store the cookware in a dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z6qlwnjYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B09289Q8M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09289Q8M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09289Q8M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000091,"name":"LED Light Up Balloons, Luminous Transparent Fillable Colorful Floating Balloon, Perfect for Birthday,Wedding, Holiday, Special Occasion and Event Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jw3J23ytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why settle for a regular party when you can jump start the celebration with our festive decorative LED Balloon!!! Features: Bright and Vivid. Each balloon come with colorful light string that can be tight around the balloons in multiple combinations to enhance any atmosphere. Specification: Balloon size: 8'' x 8'' The Largest Blowing Size: 18 ~ 20 inches Fluorescent Form: Always bright  Color: Clear Light string length: 118 inches Light color: Multi-color Material: Latex Power Supply: 2 AA batteries(not included) Handling Tips: For proper inflated size, please make sure to gently stretch each balloon in all directions before inflating. Please use pressured inflating device or else it'll not reach the full maximum size. Do not over inflate or risk the danger of bursting. Balloon can be inflated with regular air by using a balloon pump , however it'll not float in the air. All balloons must be filled with Helium otherwise it'll not float up in the air. After inflating the balloon, please secure and tightens the opening to prevent leaking. Once the balloon open is securely fasten, wrap the balloons with flashing string lights and use the battery pack to turn the light on/off Please note: Batteries, feathers, tassels, helium or air pump are not included! Please do not leave children unattended with the balloons. Do not use the Balloons in restricted area such as Air field etc. Please keep the balloons away from Fire, lighter, stove, smoking and highly populated areas. Wire / Battery box is not waterproof, please keep it away from water. Please allow 1-2cm error due to manual measurement. Due to the difference between different monitor settings, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jw3J23ytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Capital Wireless","source_asin":"B078SXGSZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SXGSZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SXGSZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
