window.products.push({"id":1000093,"name":"Dennis Daniels Wood Treasure Box Picture Frame, 2.5 x 3.5 Inches, Ebony","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pN29KTZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Craft & Scrapbooking Frames Little details bring stories to life. A concert tick and a backstage pass. A first place ribbon and a picture of a swimming lesson. A wedding invitation and a photo of the happy couple saying “I do”. Keepsakes and souvenirs tell a personal tale. Craft & Scrapbook frames put your story in place. Our Treasure Box Frames (also known as craft and scrapbook frames) put your story in place. Our Treasure Box picture frames have a depth of 1/2 inch and are crafted of hard wood with mitered corners. Featuring a hardboard back that includes a dual easel for portrait or landscape orientation and recessed wall mounts for easy hanging. Dennis Daniels Designs For over 20 years, Dennis Daniels Designs has been providing quality frames to fit any decor and occasion. It's a beautiful world; it's all in how you frame it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pN29KTZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dennis Daniels Co.","source_asin":"B000KZV4ZU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000KZV4ZU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000KZV4ZU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000094,"name":"Dentist Party Tooth and Toothbrush Cookie Cutter 2 Piece Set from The Cookie Cutter Shop – Tin Plated Steel Cookie Cutters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614SCzSrHZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dentist Party Tooth and Toothbrush Cookie Cutter 2 Piece Set; Each cookie cutter is made from tin plated steel and is food grade certified. Each has rolled edges on top making it safe and comfortable to handle. They all have a sharp bottom which allows for accurate cutting that creates impressive results. Set Includes: 2.75 inch Tooth, 5 inch Toothbrush; Each are heavy-duty tested and certified food-grade tin plated steel Our cookie cutters are perfect for so many projects. They are great for cutting cookie dough, brownies, cakes, fondant, soft fruits, vegetables, bread, cheese, sandwiches and craft clay. In addition, use your cookie cutters as a pancake mold or in the classroom as drawing tools. The possibilities are endless! Use our Dentist Party Tooth and Toothbrush Cookie Cutter 2 Piece Set to bake some delicious cookies and decorate them to server at birthday parties, weddings, summer picnics, church or school functions, bake sales or to your family and friends. Cookie Cutter Care – After using your cookie cutters, hand wash and towel dry them. Then place them on a clean cookie sheet in your oven as it cools down from baking. The heat will dry out any remaining water that you may have missed from towel drying. Tin plated steel cookie cutters are NOT Dishwasher Safe. The Cookie Cutter Shop has been operating since 1999 and offers hundreds of unique cookie cutters for you to choose from. Our goal is to offer warm hospitality, encourage smiles, and provide honest customer service, quality products and fast shipping on all orders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614SCzSrHZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE COOKIE CUTTER SHOP SINCE 1999","source_asin":"B07PGQKZCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PGQKZCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PGQKZCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000095,"name":"Elegant Unity White Candle Set of 3, 1 Pillar 6 Inch Tall and 2 Taper Candles 10 Inch Tall (Holders is Not Included) Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AatQcbHZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Elegant Unity White includes 3 Elegant candles 1 Pillar 6 Inch Tall with 2 taper candles 10 inch tall that can be decorated to match your custom wedding decor or used without adornment for a sleek and sophisticated look. Lighting a Unity Candle during your wedding ceremony is a special way to symbolize joining together With Bunch Of Love . Decorated candles are also beautiful additions to receptions and other events celebrating love. Your wedding deserves the best - and the best comes from Shop A Candle, the leader of High quality candles products .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AatQcbHZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Light In The Dark","source_asin":"B007M2EDPC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007M2EDPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007M2EDPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000096,"name":"Hollywood Thread T-Rex Small Arms I Love You This Much Sad Face Decorative Linen Throw Cushion Pillow Case with Insert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815rJGL9u9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pillow Case & Pillow Insert BOTH INCLUDED: You get a beautiful hand assembled pillow including BOTH pillow case and pillow insert. Don't be fooled by cheap imitations who only sell the pillow case. Who wants just a pillow case for a gift? Enjoy and give the gift of a ready to use Hollywood Thread decorative pillow to love for a lifetime. Style & Quality: Pillow case is made of a high quality linen textured material in a classic beige tan color delightfully soft and with stain resistant durability. Inside of a low profile color matching zipper, is a generously stuffed corner-to-corner full hypoallergenic pillow insert filled with soft poly-cotton. Express the Your Personality: Be the envy of your friends with this new T-Rex Small Arms I Love You This Much Sad Face Pillow Case with Insert. Great as a gift or to showcase your personality and have fun! Perfect Size: A shapely square throw pillow measuring 16 X 16 inches (approximately 45 X 45cm) strikes the ideal balance between decorative accent and functional cushion for your head and body. Excellent for naps. Premium USA Printing: Printed and assembled in the USA with a safe, high-tech, eco-friendly digital dye process resulting in texture free, vibrant colors that will never fade. Machine washable, wrinkle resistant and backed by the Hollywood Thread 100% Satisfaction Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815rJGL9u9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hollywood Thread","source_asin":"B07DHDPMD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DHDPMD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DHDPMD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
