window.products.push({"id":1000130,"name":"Snow Globe Christmas String_Lights 10 LED Mini Christmas Tree Snowflake Globe Bulb Lights Strand, Holiday String_Lights for Family Friends, Battery Op","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uU94g+QmL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Christmas LED String Lights with Wishing Bottle --- Each jar contains a customized Christmas themed LED that emits warm light. It looks beautiful when turn on in the night, making every light look like it holds a tiny world. For girls and children, with such beautiful decorative string lights, they will be happy with such romantic atmosphere and like the fantastic scene. Bring the perfect ambience to any indoor or outdoor space, chooses warm white for year-round or select colors for holidays and any special occasion. The string light bottles are suitable for wishing bottles, mini drift bottles, message bottles, indoor decoration bottles, wedding favors, party decorations, birthday accessories and more; DIY by yourself with best wishes, easily surprise the person who received it. Specifications: Material: Plastic, PS Power supply: 2 AA batteries (not included) Waterproof level: IP44 Optional style: A: Christmas tree bulb (1.5m/4.92ft), B: Christmas tree bottle (1.5m/4.92ft), C: Christmas tree bottle (2m/6.56ft), D: Pink green snow ball (1.5m/4.92ft), E: Colorful snow ball (1.5m/4.92ft), F: Red green snow ball (1.5m/4.92ft) Features: 1. Christmas wishing bottle shape, beautiful and romantic. 2. The LED lights string is powered by low voltage and will not overheat after long time use. 3. Soft and warm LED lights add to the warm and happy atmosphere of Christmas. 4. The battery box design does not require wiring and is easy to move to any place. 5. Fine workmanship, durable to use. Notes: 1. Light shooting and different displays may cause the color of the item in the picture a little different from the real thing. 2. The measurement allowed error is +/- 1-3cm. Package Contents 1 * String light with wishing bottle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uU94g+QmL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gupgi","source_asin":"B09KC89784","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KC89784","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KC89784","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
