window.products.push({"id":1000266,"name":"JRing Time Locking Container Pantry Food Storage Lock Box that Collecting Food Medicines Gaming Machine to Prevent Over Sweet Food Snack and Playing G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVjgCEpoL._AC_SL1424_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Material: JRing time locking box is made of BPA-free materials, along with simple buttons to set up that is designed for people who want to change bad habits, have addictions, or want to save but spend more, the time-locking bin could store snacks, phones, candy, medicine, credit card or other things, the timed locking feature would not reopen until the time over, help you fight temptation and bad habits. Build Good Habits: Overusing mobile phones, playing gamepads, having much chocolates, candies, alcohol, cigarettes and snacks would affect your life and health. We could use this time locking container to prevent this situation, set a certain time to control activities, and build good habits to live a healthy life. Easy to Use: Please do not pull out the error-proof pin before installing the battery. Please don't forget to take out the manual and power cord before unplugging the pin. If the box is locked before installing the battery, insert the power cord into the DC hole to provide power, then press \"H\" and \"M\" simultaneously for 3s. After installing the battery, press the \"H\" and \"M\" buttons to set the time, then press the middle \"Lock\" button, wait for 5s then the time safe box would lock. Multifunctional Time Box: Timed locking containers have a variety of uses, perfect for kids, students, and adults to make their focus on studying or working and make a good habit, also can help you control your consumption habits. Time locking bin could be applied to multiple situations, if you want to quit smoking, but unconsciously smoke, or if you want to save money but spend too much, you can try to use the time box. Safe Locked Box: The time lock box is a good safe box to keep children from potentially dangerous things like knives, insecticides, pills, medicine, etc. You can use it to keep tempting things locked up when your kids lack self-control. It could set 999 hours max. And if you have any problems, please feel free to contact JRing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVjgCEpoL._AC_SL1424_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JRing","source_asin":"B083S74RQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083S74RQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083S74RQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
