window.products.push({"id":1000391,"name":"Perforated Silicone Baking Mats, 2 PCS Eclair Silicone Mat for Half Sheet with 12 Printed Oblong Eclair Guides, Non-Stick Reusable Oven Liners for Mak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UTcuvQ4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【AMYONE's Perfect Eclair Baking Mat】Using appropriate Eclair Baking Mat, you can make the perfect eclairs like a professional. Premium quality non-toxic silicone materials and no greasing required, which can help bring yourself, your families or friends healthy baked food. This silicone mesh baking mat perfectly matchs the conditions which making eclair needs: Heat resistant up to 480°F, good heat conduction, and lovely printed eclair guides for exact oblong shape. 【Amazing Silicone Mesh Mat-High Efficience】 High-tech of manufacturing contributes to the best baking efficiency of this Eclair Baking Mat. Perforated Steaming Mesh makes the baking mat breathable. So rapid and uniform conduction of heat and flow of steam become possible, which helps you make soft, tender, fluffy, puffed and crisp baked food. While half size and 12 clear printed oblong guides go a step further to help you make eclairs more quickly and easily. 【A Breathing Perforated Silicone Baking Mat】The greatest advantage of this silicone mesh mat with holes is its perforated mesh, which makes it a breathing silicone baking sheet. Different from other silicone baking mats, it doesn't have completely smooth surface. However, just this special structure contributes to your vivid baking experience with stream. Imaging baking eclairs with your kids, in happy atmosphere. 【Non-Stick Surface & No More Scrubbing Worried About】To clean the baking mats, just rinse the mat in warm soapy water, even when burnt sugar falls off on it. Dishwasher safe. Repeated uses and washing cycles will not prominently affect the properties of the mat. After every use and cleanup, it will be just like new again. 【Multipurpose Perforated Baking Mat-Veriaty Using Areas】Reinforced Internal Structure for multiple use. Can be used as eclair baking mat, oven liner, pastry mat, bread mat, oven liners for bottom of oven, cookie mat, croissant mat. Oven, Microwave, and Freezer safe. You can also use it for kneading, rolling, bread making, dumplings, fruits and vegetables, freezing meat balls, or even cross-stitch embroidery, if you like. So begin you baking journey right now, with this silicone mech mat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UTcuvQ4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMYONE","source_asin":"B09NM6TP7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NM6TP7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NM6TP7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000392,"name":"Aloha Bay Votive Eco Palm Wax Candle Mountain Mist, 2 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rwLbwsAqL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"In 1993, Aloha Bay opened our first candle factory in Lower Lake, California. At this 10,000 square foot factory, our staff first began crafting candles for the gift market and now the natural health market. Bart Burger, our CEO, has developed a system for candle making that depends on employing as many human hands as possible, rather than relying on fully automated factory systems. This increases the employment rate and makes a significant contribution to living in the lovely, small town of Lower Lake, California.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rwLbwsAqL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aloha Bay","source_asin":"B000NW4GUA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NW4GUA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NW4GUA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
