window.products.push({"id":1000492,"name":"Caspari Christmas Ballet 3D Advent Calendar - 1 Each","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810xjhJyJ5L._AC_SL1351_.jpg","description":"As a tradition dating back to the mid-1800s, advent calendars are a truly classic holiday staple. Originally, they were designed to mark the days of “Advent”, a four week holiday period leading up to the Feast of the Nativity, which was not always on standard dates. The calendars served as the original “reason for the season” reminders in many families homes. Today, we use it as an exciting way to count up the 24 days before December 25th, our Christmas. Build anticipation and keep track of your Christmas countdown with family, coworkers, classmates, and more by pulling open one of the small numbered doors each day. Each calendar is constructed from durable cardstock and features festive holiday artwork and designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810xjhJyJ5L._AC_SL1351_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B00WGMH5CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WGMH5CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WGMH5CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000493,"name":"Baker's Pride 3-inch x 1.75-inch Heavy Gauge Non Stick Professional 12-Piece Cup Dessert Pan with Loose Bases","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tRDc-mxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This Professional quality Pan enables you to make 12 individual desserts such as baked cheesecakes, chocolate puddings, scones, large muffins, or mini Victoria sponge cakes. You could also make individual cheese soufflés. Each cup measures 7.5cm diameter x 4.5cm deep (3” x 1¾”), and they have loose bases, which make it easy to release your desserts or soufflés. The external measurements of the pan are 39.5 cm long x 28.25 cm wide x 5 cm deep (15½” long x 11¼” wide x 2” deep). The premium quality, PFOA-free, non-stick coating, gives a professional performance and makes it easy to clean. We recommend you hand wash this product. It is manufactured from heavy gauge steel to ensure quick and even heat distribution and make it resistant to warping, and rolled edges give it extra stability and support against warping. Baker’s Pride is a brand of bakeware from Dexam which offers outstanding quality at excellent value. It includes a wide range of specialist bakeware such as French Bread Pans, Mince Pie Pans and Madeleine Pans, alongside tried and tested favourites, like Baking Trays and Muffin Pans, to cover a variety of baking needs. At Dexam we are passionate about food. And that means we are passionate about the tools a cook needs to make a delicious meal. Since 1957 Dexam has produced and distributed high quality and innovative kitchenware, and we’re proud of it. Set Contains: 1 x 12 cup Dessert Pan with 12 loose bases","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tRDc-mxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baker's Pride Professional","source_asin":"B00CKL64D4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CKL64D4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CKL64D4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
