window.products.push({"id":1000549,"name":"Bemis DP3-200 2 in 1 Humidifier-Air Purifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q4QPQ91TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Tabeltop style 2 in 1 air purifier and humidifier cleans air and humidifies with one appliance, can be used as a stand alone air purifier, CADR pollen 110, dust 125, smoke 90, cleans air in a 12x14 room every 15 minutes. 3.3 gallons of output per day humidifies 750 sq. ft., automatic humidistat maintains optimum humidity level, 3-speeds, quiet nighttime setting, lock-on feature to run air purifier only, dual Bemis-patented super wicks, electrostatic air purifier filter, 191/2x12x131/4, 14lbs. Color-Granite Amazon.com A two-in-one device, this unit reduces smoke, pollen, dust, pet dander, mold, and odor particles in a closed room's air while simultaneously humidifying it. The humidifier is certified up to 750 square feet. The purifier, however, produces just four air changes per hour--two fewer than generally accepted as desirable--in a room of only 168 square feet. That said, using the unit is an inexpensive way to humidify a room and get some air-cleaning capability as well. Two removable bottles evaporate 3.3 gallons of water in 24 hours. A humidistat automatically controls humidity at a selected level. (It can be turned off during high-humidity months, when only the air cleaner is needed.) The humidifier's wicks may be rinsed and the purifier's electrostatically charged filter vacuumed to prolong their lives. Bemis recommends replacing the wicks once during a humidifying season and the filter at the end of each season. The unit carries a two-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q4QPQ91TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bemis","source_asin":"B00004TQ7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004TQ7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004TQ7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
