window.products.push({"id":1000552,"name":"Ceramic Backflow Incese Holder Watefall Incense Burnr,Home Decor Aromatherapy Ornament with 120 Backflow Incense Conse and 30 Incense Sitck (Pineapple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kZYI4P8OL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This is an exquisite piece of art! 1.After igniting the incense cone, you can watch the aroma smoke like a waterfall flowing down, which is very beautiful. 2.The beautiful shape and pleasant aroma can bring people a feeling of physical and mental pleasure, whether it is work or conversation, can bring peace and quiet atmosphere. 3.Whether it is in the living room, bedroom, study, or in the office, yoga room, hotel, sauna, it is very suitable. Even if it does not ignite the incense, it can be used as a very beautiful ornament. 4.The incense holder is hand-kneaded by skilled craftsmen using purple sand clay, and calcined at a high temperature above 1000°C , it has very beautiful natural texture. For homes, offices, guests ignite the incense cone 5 minutes before the visit. Fresh air, elegant aroma, this is not only courtesy, respect, but also reflects your elegant taste. How to use: 1.Choose a flat, windless place to place the incense holder, ignite the sharp part of the incense cone. 2.Place the incense cone on top of the incense holder and wait a few minutes for the smoke to flow down slowly, a fantastic waterfall display. 3. Align the hole at the bottom of the incense cone with the hole at the top of the incense holder for optimum flue gas flow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kZYI4P8OL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHN1","source_asin":"B08G4WBC4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G4WBC4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G4WBC4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000553,"name":"Polibi Full Size Platform Bed, Metal and Wood Bed Frame with Headboard and Footboard, No Box Spring Needed (White, Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":117.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911I6rnSp5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sturdy Metal Bed Frame】Polibi metal bed frame with beautiful headboard & footboard, Rustic Country, Antique or Retro industrial, suitable for any bedroom style decoration. Constructed of metal tube, the metal bed is finished in pewter matte finishing. Airy and structural, the metal bed brings decorative elements to your Industrial style bedroom. 【Platform Bed with Under Space】13.5” clearance, with plenty of under bed space for space saving and easy organization. Featuring a sleek metal design with a rectangular oak finish headboard & footboard, the Industrial style and contemporary iron metal bed creates a look that’s bold and attention-grabbing. 【Metal bed slats and Supporting Legs】 Reinforced leg structure and durable metal slats are strong enough to support the mattress, prevent sinking and moving, lengthen usage life, and give you a quiet and comfortable sleeping environment. There are 3 supporting legs in the middle and one supporting leg on each side of the bed to increase the stability of the bed. 【No Box Spring Needed】Metal slats are sturdy to support mattress without the use of a box spring, non-squeak, non-noise. Features quickly to construct and dismantle and move; light in weight and offer strength required to accommodate overall weight. 【Overall Dimension】Twin bed: 77.5\"L x39\"W x39.5\"H; Full bed: 77.5\"L x54\"W x39.5\"H. Mattress not included. Some assembly is required, although we have provided clear instructions and tools. If you have any questions, please don’t hesitate to contact one of our friendly customer service representatives. With worry free 1 year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911I6rnSp5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polibi","source_asin":"B097TF9VHV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097TF9VHV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097TF9VHV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
