window.products.push({"id":1000577,"name":"Indian Traditional Decorative Silk Dining Table Runner, Red Elephant Embroidery Handmade Dining Table Runner Table Runner for Wedding, Birthday Décor,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D-Vf6P1zL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"These Stunning Table Runners Are Elegant And Durable, They Add A Classy, Fresh Touch Wherever Table Runner Are Placed On Your Dining Table, Coffee Table, Bureau, Piano, Mantle Or Bed-In Any Room Of Your Home. These Appealing Runners Can Be Washed Easily And Used Again And Again, Year Round Or For Special Occasions. They Make For A Great House-Warming Or Holiday Gift, As They Are Classy, Durable And Multi-Purpose. With Intricate Designs And A Glossy Finish, These Runners Are A Year-Round Favorite, And Promise To Endlessly Enhance Your Decor Possibilities. Floral Vines Illuminate Their Way Through Fields Of Flowers, Embroidered By Hand. Enhanced With Multicolored Patchwork, Glittering Sequins And Bead Work Celebrate Spring Enchantment. These Exuberant Colors Of Tribal Patchwork Are From Nomadic Banjara Region Around Rajasthan, India. Lined In Purple, The Cotton Runner Is Individually Crafted, Thus Colors And Motifs Can Vary Slightly. Can Be Used As A Runner, Tapestry Or Hanging To Brighten The Mood Around The House. #Hashtag: Yoga Studio, Indian Table Decoration Gypsy, Room, Yoga Spiritual, Buddhist, Handmade, Fair Trade, Boho, Murals, Woven Handcrafted Flower Fabric Natural Party Wedding Events Banquet Kitchen Living Room Bedroom Studio Office Linen Square Rectangular Canvas Bridal Birthday Large Bedding Nature Decorative Collage Dorm Living Room Bedroom Yoga Bright Psychedelic Table Cloth Yoga Studio Gypsy Forest Animal Monkey Flower Birds Elephant Throw Queen Twin Medium Multi Color Indian Ethnic Tribal Geometric Dorm Flower Display Textile Bedroom Nature Medium Tribal Ethnic Fair Trade Door Printed Pattern Backdrop Tribe Azure Fair Trade Floral Embroidered Colorful Silk Tapestry Wall Hanging Decor Art Home Boho Bohemian Hippie.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D-Vf6P1zL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B63L39RS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63L39RS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63L39RS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
