window.products.push({"id":1000707,"name":"Laxinis World Universal Knife Block, Stainless-Steel Modern Rectangular Design with Scissors-Slot, Knife Holder Counter-top Storage, Holds 12 8”-Blade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xt3zCJmhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Laxinis World universal knife block is manufactured with the average American girl (or man!) in mind. Most of us cook in moderately-sized kitchens, yet we own a huge amount of cooking equipment like different-sized pots, various kitchen gadgets, an assortment of dishes for all occasions, and of course; knives! Knives come in so many sizes, shapes, and uses for all the many culinary creations we churn out daily to feed the household (or just ourselves.) All those knives need a proper place to stay if you want them to stay sharp and useful and live a long life. So… Time to get organized! Here are some important factors to consider before purchasing a knife block: SIZE: It’s important to ensure that your most frequently used knives will fit into the slots of the knife block, so measure the size of your knives before choosing a knife block. The Laxinis World Universal Knife Block sports a slotless design so that all knives with blades up to 8” long will fit easily into the block. In fact, it easily holds up to 12 knives! A PLACE TO PUT THE BLOCK ON: Walking off with a compact design that packs the punch is the way to go when choosing a knife block, especially if your countertop space is limited. The Laxinis World Universal Knife Block measures a slim 9.1”x4” and fits up to 12 large knives with blades up to 8” long. Keep it tucked into a corner or in a strategic place on the countertop or shelf. DESIGN: While it’s true that the main focus when buying a knife block should be practicality and functionality, an aesthetically pleasing block can make your kitchen look more appealing. The Laxinis World Universal Knife Block is fingerprint resistant, and has a smooth rounded rectangular body with a timeless stainless-steel colored frame for a modern look and a match-all value. Now get ‘em all in and get cutting!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xt3zCJmhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laxinis World","source_asin":"B07XSNZFK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XSNZFK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XSNZFK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000708,"name":"Witmoving Mini USB Hunidifier 240ml Small Desk Humidifiers Portable Cool Mist 7 Color Light Auto Shut-off Personal Cup Humidifiers for Bedroom Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m8uo8ZQ8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"NOTE: Please add mineral water and filtered tap water！ Do not add distilled water and pure water！ Do not add essential Oils and perfumes！ Why we don't recommend using distilled water or pure water? Some of customer said they found the water drop on the device, here is the reason: There's no mineral or impurities in distilled water or pure water，so the mist will combine with impurities such as dust in the air to form water droplets, and make the top of humidifier wet.  Product Type: Portable USB Desk Humidifier Material: ABS + PP Water Capacity: 240ml Size:2.45*2.45*6.45inch/6.2*6.2*16.4CM Weight:5.6oz/160g Light Color: 7 color Mode: 2 modes (continuous / inteval spray) Package List： USB Desk Humidifier x 1 Filter x 1 USB Charging Cable x 1 User Manual x 1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m8uo8ZQ8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WitMoving","source_asin":"B07W6YBSDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W6YBSDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W6YBSDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000709,"name":"Cord Organizer for Appliances 10Pcs Upgraded Kitchen Cord Winder Wrapper Small Home Appliance Cord Keeper Tidy Wrap Cord Organizer Stick On Blender Mi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BWlBeJxHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"UPGRADED APPLIANCE CORD ORGANIZER - Our appliance cord winder is made of softer flexible rubber material, while the adhesive base area is larger than other ordinary appliance cord winder, which can perfectly fit the curved surface of the appliance, more durable and not easy to fall off. SAY GOODBYE TO MESS - If you are tired of organizing power cables of various kitchen appliances, this appliance cord organizer will save you from this trouble. Compatible with various kitchen appliances, get your wires out of the mess, save space and keep your kitchen tidy and clear. EASY TO INSTALL - Before using the cord organizer for appliances, wipe the surface to be pasted clean, after peeling off the film on the back of the appliance cord wrapper, then apply light pressure to the center of the base for about 15-20 seconds, wait 24 hours after pasting, and then use it. WIDE APPLICATION - These appliances cord wrapper are suitable for your kitchen appliance power cords, such as coffee machine, mixer, air fryer, toaster, juicer, microwave oven, rice cooker and more. Also suitable for small home appliances, such as computers, fans, floor robots, vacuum cleaners, etc. WHAT YOU GET - You will receive 10pcs kitchen cord organizer and 10pcs reusable fastening cable ties and an instructions manual, which is compatible with 90% of kitchen equipment wires. If there is any problem with the product, please feel free to contact us and we are sure to offer you satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BWlBeJxHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meltset M","source_asin":"B0B8YX39BT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YX39BT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YX39BT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1000710,"name":"Samoyed My Best Friend Magnet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4oLDijYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Friends of the homo sapien variety just won't do for you. Show the world who comes first in your life with this vinyl car magnet. A portrait of a Samoyed is highlighted by a red background, while the black border surrounding the image, accented with white paw prints, has the breed's name at the top and \"my best friend\" below. Place this magnet on any metal surface to prove your loyalty to your best bud.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4oLDijYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pet Gifts USA","source_asin":"B00NJ3H63O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NJ3H63O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NJ3H63O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
