window.products.push({"id":1000890,"name":"VEHHE Reusable Straws 8 Set Multi Color Stainless Steel Straws - Cleaning Brush for 20 Oz (Rainbow 8.5 inch + 10.5 inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IWXwNQQGL._AC_SL1134_.jpg","description":"FIT FOR ALL SIZE TUMBLERS: straight rainbow stainless steel straws of 8.5” and bent rainbow stainless steel straws of 10.5”for 20oz tumblers tumblers. Perfect for you to enjoy your cold bevarage, sipping cocktail, coffee, ice tea, cappuccino etc by these colorful metal straws. TOP FOOD-GRADE 18/8 304 STAINLESS STEEL: MADE of top food grade 304 stainless steel, the drinking metal straws are the natural choice for everyone, which is BPA free, plastic free, no metal aftertaste, no oxidation, colorfast, dishwasher safe, reusable and environmentally friendly. One set of stainless steel straws can be used for years to come - replacing hundreds or thousands of plastic straws. PORTABLE BAG & MULTI - FUNCTIONAL: Modern and sleek design, with the Cotton and Linen Material bag, this drinking stainless steel straws is easy to carry by your handbag and it is easy to seal by pulling the cord. These colored metal straws look equally beautiful in a cocktail or a smoothie, which add fun to any party, trendy for family reunion, girls night out,cocktail party, picnics, boating and so on. 2 FREE SCRUB BRUSH & EASY TO CLEAN: Come with 2 special scrub brush, with this banister brush, you can clean your stainless steel straws more easily and never worry about hurting your drinking straws. You can also hang the brush easily by its annulus at the end. To clean the stainless steel straws, you just need to hold the handle of the brush and let nylon bristles come into the stainless straws, the brush is of the perfect size for these drinking straws. ECO-FRIENDLY, REUSABLE, REDUCE PLASTIC POLLUTION: No more plastic straws - ever! To protect our earth, we should use this stainless steel straws instead of plastic fast food packaging containers, to protect the environment, reduce the white pollution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IWXwNQQGL._AC_SL1134_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEHHE","source_asin":"B09NNDRLDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNDRLDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNDRLDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
